<%- include('partials/header') %>
<div class="container mt-4">
  <h2 class="fw-bold mb-3"><i class="fas fa-question-circle text-danger me-2"></i>FAQ</h2>
  <div class="accordion" id="faq">
    <div class="accordion-item" style="border-radius:14px; overflow:hidden; margin-bottom:12px; border:1px solid #e2e8f0;">
      <h2 class="accordion-header"><button class="accordion-button fw-bold" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#f1">How fast is Turso serverless?</button></h2>
      <div id="f1" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" data-bs-parent="#faq"><div class="accordion-body text-muted">BloodOra on Node.js + Turso libSQL offers edge replication, low latency, and instant ACID transactions — same theme, zero bugs.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="accordion-item" style="border-radius:14px; overflow:hidden; margin-bottom:12px; border:1px solid #e2e8f0;">
      <h2 class="accordion-header"><button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-bold" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#f2">Why only Kalai for delivery?</button></h2>
      <div id="f2" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faq"><div class="accordion-body text-muted">Pilot delivery is Kalai only (৳10 flat). We validate Upazila on both client and server to prevent mistakes.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="accordion-item" style="border-radius:14px; overflow:hidden; margin-bottom:12px; border:1px solid #e2e8f0;">
      <h2 class="accordion-header"><button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-bold" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#f3">How to become verified donor?</button></h2>
      <div id="f3" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faq"><div class="accordion-body text-muted">Register, be 18+, upload correct info. Admin verifies within 24h. Toggle availability after verification.</div></div>
    </div>
    <div class="accordion-item" style="border-radius:14px; overflow:hidden; border:1px solid #e2e8f0;">
      <h2 class="accordion-header"><button class="accordion-button collapsed fw-bold" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#f4">Shop payment methods?</button></h2>
      <div id="f4" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faq"><div class="accordion-body text-muted">bKash, Nagad, Upay, Rocket, Pathao Pay, Card, and Cash on Delivery. Numbers are saved for next order.</div></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
